error[E0277]: `Url` cannot be interpolated into a URL that loads script, styles or plug-ins
  --> tests/ui/reject_url_elsewhere.rs:20:14
   |
20 |     resource(url.clone());
   |     -------- ^^^^^^^^^^^ even an `https:` URL would run code or styles from wherever it points
   |     |
   |     required by a bound introduced by this call
   |
   = help: the trait `ResourceValue` is not implemented for `Url`
   = note: use a fixed URL, or a type implementing `hemplate::ResourceValue` that can only name files you serve
   = note: or vouch for the URL with `hemplate::TrustedResource::new_unchecked(..)`
note: required by a bound in `resource`
  --> tests/ui/reject_url_elsewhere.rs:10:21
   |
10 | fn resource(_: impl ResourceValue) {}
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `resource`

